    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "c3_title",
      "x": 42,
      "y": 760,
      "width": 328,
      "height": 17,
      "text": "Dependency Ordering & Skeleton Scaffolding",
      "originalText": "Dependency Ordering & Skeleton Scaffolding",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 11
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "c3_body",
      "x": 42,
      "y": 782,
      "width": 436,
      "height": 69,
      "text": "Decomposes large codebases into atomic AST fragments that fit\nLLM context limits. Performs reverse-topological sorting so\ndependencies translate before consumers, resolves cyclic import\ndependencies with stub scheduling, and generates compilable target\nskeleton files to anchor downstream translation passes.",
      "originalText": "Decomposes large codebases into atomic AST fragments that fit\nLLM context limits. Performs reverse-topological sorting so\ndependencies translate before consumers, resolves cyclic import\ndependencies with stub scheduling, and generates compilable target\nskeleton files to anchor downstream translation passes.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 9
    },
