    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "c5_title",
      "x": 1862,
      "y": 1050,
      "width": 297,
      "height": 17,
      "text": "Adversarial Role-Flip De-Hallucination",
      "originalText": "Adversarial Role-Flip De-Hallucination",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 11
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "c5_body",
      "x": 1862,
      "y": 1072,
      "width": 436,
      "height": 69,
      "text": "Mitigates LLM sycophancy before wasting expensive compiler cycles.\nRe-prompts an independent model as an adversarial code auditor\nmandated to find defects, fabricated APIs, or syntax bugs.\nSurfaces hallucinated calls and blocks broken output before the\ntoolchain compiler ever executes.",
      "originalText": "Mitigates LLM sycophancy before wasting expensive compiler cycles.\nRe-prompts an independent model as an adversarial code auditor\nmandated to find defects, fabricated APIs, or syntax bugs.\nSurfaces hallucinated calls and blocks broken output before the\ntoolchain compiler ever executes.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 9
