    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "c7_body",
      "x": 1862,
      "y": 422,
      "width": 423,
      "height": 69,
      "text": "Compiling code can still diverge in runtime behavior.\nDeploys an ensemble of independent judge agents to score\nbehavioral equivalence between source and target implementations\nacross edge cases, evaluating semantics and execution traces.\nMajority consensus gates release.",
      "originalText": "Compiling code can still diverge in runtime behavior.\nDeploys an ensemble of independent judge agents to score\nbehavioral equivalence between source and target implementations\nacross edge cases, evaluating semantics and execution traces.\nMajority consensus gates release.",
