    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "c8_title",
      "x": 1862,
      "y": 170,
      "width": 312,
      "height": 17,
      "text": "Adaptive Iteration & Strategy Controller",
      "originalText": "Adaptive Iteration & Strategy Controller",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 11
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "c8_body",
      "x": 1862,
      "y": 192,
      "width": 403,
      "height": 69,
      "text": "Meta-learning controller triggered when validation fails.\nIf translation plateaus or fails, switches migration strategy\nvia a try-and-fail registry (e.g. Big Bang -> Incremental),\nre-tunes active tools and parameters, and bundles prioritized\ncompiler diagnostics into a distilled repair packet.",
      "originalText": "Meta-learning controller triggered when validation fails.\nIf translation plateaus or fails, switches migration strategy\nvia a try-and-fail registry (e.g. Big Bang -> Incremental),\nre-tunes active tools and parameters, and bundles prioritized\ncompiler diagnostics into a distilled repair packet.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 9
